      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Once ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2717"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2717",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " is finished,  this issue should be complete as well since DELETEs are currently disallowed for all resources where acl:Append applies.  Same is true for PUT, which is currently allowed in both the LDP-NR and LDP-RS cases when the resource does not exist. Completion of 2717 will ensure that it is denied when resource exists.   Finally POST on an LDP-NR is rejected already whether or not acl:Append applies.  The work of this ticket will likely be to add any missing integration tests. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
