       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/3707b443358c8c223f9eec7a7d29ba88?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FDB-4.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Danny Bernstein",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Once <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2717\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2717</a> is finished,  this issue should be complete as well since DELETEs are currently disallowed for all resources where acl:Append applies.  Same is true for PUT, which is currently allowed in both the LDP-NR and LDP-RS cases when the resource does not exist. Completion of 2717 will ensure that it is denied when resource exists.   Finally POST on an LDP-NR is rejected already whether or not acl:Append applies.  The work of this ticket will likely be to add any missing integration tests. </p>",
     "created": "04/May/18 5:28 PM",
     "id": "19988",
     "jsdPublic": true,
